# Training weights, array caches and packaged experiment/delivery output.
# Keep source, tests/fixtures, dependency manifests, assets, calibrated runtime
# resources, vendor code/licenses and curated firmware. Do not blanket-ignore
# JSON/CSV/YAML/DLL/LIB/HEX: this project uses those as runtime/build inputs.
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.onnx
*.npz
*.npy
*.joblib
*.pkl
*.pickle
*.zip
*.7z
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.whl
~$*

